  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "天公有保庇"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">大里簡（Tāi-lí-kán，宜蘭大里）ê天公廟講beh翻厝尾頂ê舊瓦，欠一台貨仔車載柴料kap枋模，阿爸伊khah熱性，就招我去hia做公工，起起落落搬差不多五tsuā ê khang-khuè，tsiânn緊就煞--ah。 Beh走ê進前，廟公kā一塊吊tī運轉台ê平安符替我kat hōo好勢，tsiah kap阮sio辭。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Uat出去廟埕是下晡2點hit跤兜，我kan-na穿內衫、短褲，窗仔門總kā絞落來搧風，mā是熱到叫m̄敢；駛到倚海ê大路，隨鼻著海風ê鹹濕味，mā看著青ling-ling ê海水，車內即時有淡薄仔涼涼，人就ke爽快濟--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">沿路無啥車leh走，阿爸坐踮邊--a早就睏kah kônn-kônn叫，是m̄是舞了siunn忝，連我mā目睭皮愈來愈重，幾若遍，kheh--落-去koh金--起-來ê時tsūn，心肝頭lóng ē tshuah--一-下，kiōng-beh起雞母皮，頭殼內不時to leh大聲huah講ài停落來路邊bî--五-分-鐘，mā有叮嚀家己bē-sái tok-ku、m̄-thang睏--去……。雄雄koh金--起-來ê時tsūn，目睭前有一枝電柱直透tu倚--來，講是有khah慢，hit時tsūn bē輸有人放劍光--leh，目睭前爍--一-下，sa我ê雙手kā ha̋n-tóo-luh小可仔偏過去正爿，拄拄好hōo車頭閃--過，隨聽著後斗khê著電柱「pōng！」一聲……，車身lio̍h仔khi--去，險仔栽落去海跤；阿爸驚一下隨精神--起-來，我是差一絲仔就破膽--去；趕緊踏擋仔歇落來路邊，心肝phi̍h-pho̍k-tshíng、凊汗tsha̍p-tsha̍p滴。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Thìng候回魂--tńg-來，頭殼有khah精光ê時tsūn，tiô落來路邊巡輪胎，lóng飽飽無破風，m̄-koh倚尾溜ê車pín仔有mauh--一-搭，外漆lak tsiok大phiàn，tsit聲，若無駛去保養廠板金kám就ē煞--得。順suà越頭，看遠遠hit枝差一點仔hōo我無命ê電柱，伊恬恬tshāi tī hia，kap我烏仁對白仁，bē輸kā我會失禮、tshē-m̄-tio̍h ê款勢。Koh翻tńg身peh起去後斗巡紮去現場ê家私頭，lóng原在好好，無幌出去車外，mā無摃歹--去。上佳哉--ê是人lóng平安無代，有小可仔拍驚lik色niâ。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Koh起行ê時tsūn，阿爸講：「是車內ê平安符leh保庇，lán tsiah有tsit个福氣，後過tio̍h-ài khah tsia̍p去天公廟hia拜拜！」</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：</span><a href=\"https://reurl.cc/2WWKy4\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/2WWKy4</a><span style=\"font-size: small;\">）</span></p><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi5k1EaL5HjtbWYzLNg0MgYsU7X4uphWkBrTN-LJ2LYvePGdhBSJrpS1E4VjWm5OKLYKSpfiSBwJeZvaVp1o53K_AI8J95cClKYw90gr-kdZNqqfG3NKii4znjNEIPraNV7YlFpavfEetSY0k03uqOSkN2dmpcQH1JF9Z2oDy17ad6nn0HE9nuW7ghZtA/s1424/348%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi5k1EaL5HjtbWYzLNg0MgYsU7X4uphWkBrTN-LJ2LYvePGdhBSJrpS1E4VjWm5OKLYKSpfiSBwJeZvaVp1o53K_AI8J95cClKYw90gr-kdZNqqfG3NKii4znjNEIPraNV7YlFpavfEetSY0k03uqOSkN2dmpcQH1JF9Z2oDy17ad6nn0HE9nuW7ghZtA/w450-h640/348%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiMNKvlH2yr8iXRpE4FB_M_30iS6CF0346HiFgyEUlJg9qRKBSNODl_w68-KZ2TiUJPQwKsE_QMRFjbZllDGsgExzLMrtzlj5G2s52M0P7VE7n7Gtn6zQ0345KMal-uQVL45anxJutkLRRhwZae-ugztUTiygWTNblX3zZpeUCZPWQjzY4j1DnIJeNOuQ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1348%E6%9C%9F7.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-hei